01:00:34.720 --> 01:00:49.870
<v Ira Glass>Our website, thisamericanlife.org. You can listen to our archive of over 700 episodes for absolutely free. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange, which is celebrating its 20th anniversary.

01:00:49.870 --> 01:01:03.280
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. Last weekend, I took him to his first rave. He was so excited to finally try MDMA. And then we got there, and he was so disappointed.

01:01:03.280 --> 01:01:04.990
<v Tiya Miles>There was no Molly.

01:01:04.990 --> 01:01:09.990
